## 📋 IMPLEMENTATION CHECKLIST (for future migrations)

When implementing the support ticket system (planned v33+), this checklist MUST be satisfied:

- [ ] Create `support_tickets` table with NO `org_id` as direct FK
- [ ] Create `ticket_messages` table referencing ONLY `ticket_id` and `sender_id`
- [ ] RLS on `support_tickets`: `created_by = auth.uid() OR is_super_admin()`
- [ ] RLS on `ticket_messages`: ticket-scoped (via parent ticket access)
- [ ] Build `support.service.ts` — NO imports from `workspace-chat.service.ts` or `chat-tx.service.ts`
- [ ] Build "Report a problem" button in AppShell footer
- [ ] Build `SupportInbox.tsx` for Super Admin — ONLY shows tickets
- [ ] Audit: confirm Super Admin role still receives 0 rows on `SELECT * FROM workspace_conversations`
- [ ] Code review checklist: any PR adding chat functionality must reference this addendum

