## 🔍 AUDITABILITY

The Super Admin's INABILITY to access operational chats is itself an auditable property. The following SQL query MUST return zero rows when executed under a Super Admin auth context:

```sql
SET LOCAL ROLE authenticated;
SELECT set_config('request.jwt.claim.sub', '<super_admin_uuid>', true);

SELECT count(*) FROM workspace_conversations;        -- expected: 0
SELECT count(*) FROM workspace_messages;             -- expected: 0
SELECT count(*) FROM transaction_conversations;      -- expected: 0
SELECT count(*) FROM transaction_messages;           -- expected: 0
```

This query becomes part of the deployment smoke test suite. If any returns > 0, the deployment fails.

